    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nF (s) = \\frac {s}{(s + 1) (s + 4) ^ {2}} \\underset {\\mathrm{几重根按降幂展几项}} {\\overset {\\mathrm{单根按照单根展}} {=}} \\frac {k _ {1}}{s + 1} + \\frac {k _ {2}}{(s + 4) ^ {2}} + \\frac {k _ {3}}{s + 4}\n$$",
