    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "求 $k_{3}$ 的第二种方法：",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            85,
            322,
            102
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nF (s) = \\frac {s}{(s + 1) (s + 4) ^ {2}} = \\frac {k _ {1}}{s + 1} + \\frac {k _ {2}}{(s + 4) ^ {2}} + \\frac {k _ {3}}{s + 4}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            278,
            111,
            717,
            149
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nk _ {1} = \\left. (s + 1) F (s) \\right/ _ {s = - 1} = \\overline {{\\frac {s}{(s + 4) ^ {2}}}} \\Big / _ {s = - 1} = \\frac {- 1}{9}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            277,
