        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nk _ {2} = \\left. (s + 4) ^ {2} F (s) \\right/ _ {s = - 4} = \\frac {s}{s + 1} \\Big / _ {s = - 4} = \\frac {4}{3}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            292,
            209,
            705,
            250
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
