        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nF (s) = \\frac {s}{(s + 1) (s + 4) ^ {2}} = \\frac {\\frac {- 1}{9}}{s + 1} + \\frac {\\frac {4}{3}}{(s + 4) ^ {2}} + \\frac {k _ {3}}{s + 4}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            275,
