        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、有始周期冲激函数的LT",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            117,
            389,
            135
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/b2df48dc761d91846b7dcfba93b34d9118ae0ff104fc16b968d3845dcfd3b7ac.jpg",
        "image_caption": [
            "$\\delta(t) \\stackrel{LT}{\\leftrightarrow} 1$"
        ],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            406,
            153,
            584,
            227
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\delta (t - n T _ {1}) \\overset {L T} {\\leftrightarrow} 1 \\cdot e ^ {- s n T _ {1}}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            400,
            279,
            594,
            306
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\sum_ {n = 0} ^ {\\infty} \\delta (t - n T _ {1}) \\Rightarrow \\sum_ {n = 0} ^ {\\infty} e ^ {- n s T _ {1}} = \\frac {1}{1 - e ^ {- s T _ {1}}}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            322,
            312,
            673,
            367
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、有始周期信号的拉氏逆变换",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            390,
            426,
            407
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{c} \\sum_ {n = 0} ^ {\\infty} f _ {0} (t - n T _ {1}) = f _ {0} (t) * \\sum_ {n = 0} ^ {\\infty} \\delta (t - n T _ {1}) \\\\ \\mathcal {L} [ f (t) ] = F _ {0} (s) \\cdot \\frac {1}{1 - e ^ {- s T _ {1}}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            319,
            414,
            673,
            508
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 12：求如图所示在 t=0 时接入的有始周期信号 $f(t)$ 的象函数 $F(s)$ 。",
