    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、有始周期信号的拉氏逆变换步骤",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            85,
            467,
            102
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1)化成标准形式 $F(s)=F_{0}(s)\\cdot\\frac{1}{1-e^{-sT}}$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            114,
            480,
            149
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)对 $F_{0}(s)$ 进行拉氏逆变换得 $f_{0}(t)$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            158,
            463,
            177
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3)则 $f(t)=f_{0}(t)*\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\delta(t-nT)$ ，可适当考虑画图，便于简化表达式。",
        "bbox": [
