    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点9： $s$ 域积分的拉氏逆变换",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            147,
            85,
            468,
            105
        ],
        "page_idx": 9
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、原理：",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            117,
            231,
            134
        ],
        "page_idx": 9
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若 $f(t)\\leftrightarrow F(s)$ ，则",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            145,
            315,
            162
        ],
        "page_idx": 9
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {f (t)}{t} \\leftrightarrow \\int_ {s} ^ {\\infty} F (\\eta) d \\eta\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            410,
            170,
            579,
            210
        ],
        "page_idx": 9
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、步骤",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            244,
            225,
            261
        ],
        "page_idx": 9
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n[ l n   x ] ^ {\\prime} = \\frac {1}{x}   \\text {且}   l n \\frac {x}{y} = l n   x - l n   y\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            359,
            269,
            638,
            307
        ],
        "page_idx": 9
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "则",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            315,
            173,
            332
        ],
        "page_idx": 9
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\int_ {s} ^ {\\infty} \\frac {1}{\\eta} d \\eta = l n x \\Big | _ {s} ^ {\\infty} = l n \\infty - l n s\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            359,
            341,
            638,
            380
        ],
        "page_idx": 9
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例15: 求 $F(s) = \\ln \\frac{s - 1}{s}$ 的拉普拉斯逆变换。",
        "bbox": [
